      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what? \"A group of goblins planning a heist\" and \"rival goblin clans\"? Are you serious? \n\nThis is a multi-million dollar logistics emergency involving food safety and industrial hardware. I am not looking for a bedtime story or a fantasy metaphor about goblins. I need professional, technical expertise to prevent a massive loss of inventory.\n\nPlease drop the analogies completely. Focus on the technical framework. You mentioned signal analysis and EMI—get straight to the point. What specific technical indicators or electromagnetic signatures should my engineering team be looking for to distinguish between a malfunctioning sensor and external signal interference? I need actionable data, not folklore.",
